{"id":"c5h24mb8se8comgb4z9cle4qg","title":"《唯波论》概要与目录","originalTitle":null,"summary":"《唯波论》是郭磊著的一部横跨物理学、哲学与生命感悟的思想著作，核心命题认为宇宙间万事万物的本质是\"波\"，并提出\"中者生存律\"。书中通过回顾物理学史、双缝实验和薛定谔的猫等实验，瓦解粒子概念，提出六种基波的本体论框架，并探讨暗物质、量子纠缠等未解之谜。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=230383&do=blog&id=1560166"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T11:46:55.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T01:09:31.265Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T01:09:31.265Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表"],"score":25,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5da8ace5-eace-4575-b033-c2b6666cea4a","title":"郭磊《唯波论》提出万物本质为波"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5da8ace5-eace-4575-b033-c2b6666cea4a","title":"郭磊《唯波论》提出万物本质为波"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fzv0xYVM7P-k","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}